                                                "sense_id": "948ddb7b-d8cb-3bda-857f-66b4aa80e855",
                                                "text": "Side arms provide slow-flowing water bodies that allow the development of aquatic vegetation used as spawning substrate by several limnophilous and potamophilous species, such as white bream, pike and tench."
